[manifest]
desc="An Android container environment based on redroid-rk3588. ADB port 5555 is exposed by default.<br>Risk warning: Without additional adaptation, some games, social, payment, financial, or other high-risk-control applications may identify redroid as an abnormal environment. This may result in login restrictions, device blacklisting, account suspension, asset freezes, or permanent loss of service.<br>Do not test with important accounts. You are solely responsible for assessing and accepting these risks.<br>The container image is pulled on first startup. This may take a long time on slow networks; please wait.<br>Configure your firewall correctly and allow access to ADB port 5555 only from trusted devices to prevent unauthorized access.<br>This application was packaged by a community volunteer. Do not contact the system vendor about usage issues."

